



<div class="row">
    <partial name="SideMenu" />

    <!--Main Content-->
    <div class="col mt-3">
        <div class="text-center">

            <h1 class="display-4 mb-3 mb-md-5">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

            <div class="accordion text-start col-8 offset-2" id="faq-accordian">

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                            How do I apply?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faq-accordian">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            If you do not yet have an account, then you must first create one by clicking on log in, then register.
                            Otherwise, click the <strong>Apply Now</strong> button on the left-hand menu and fill out the application. After a
                            Medicaid employee has reviewed your application, you will be notified as to whether or not you have met the qualification.

                            <br />
                            <br />

                            Be prepared to show documented proof for things like work hours, volunteer hours, disability, and any other claim that requires validation.
                            <br />
                            <br />

                            You can always look at the status of your application using the <strong>Application Status</strong> menu option located on the left-hand menu.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                            Are my login credentials protected?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faq-accordian">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            MEVA encrypts user credentials using SHA256 hashing and salting to ensure the highest level  of protection.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                            How long does the application reviewing process take?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faq-accordian">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Typically no longer than a week, but it may take longer if MEVA experiences higher levels of application submissions than usual.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>


        </div>
    </div>
</div>